El FC Barcelona emitió un comunicado condenando los hechos y defendiendo el uso de la estelada, asegurando que es legal.

## Summary
Marlaska has ordered an investigation into agents who charged against a Barcelona fan to seize an Estelada flag. FC Barcelona condemned the incident and stated that the use of the Estelada is legal.

